Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:27.50,Title,,0,0,0,,THE WORLD'S FIRST PODCAST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,What you meant to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:01.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,say is a trip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:02.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,without your kids which
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:03.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,is different than a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:04.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,trip with your kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:06.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Like we've said multiple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:06.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,times there is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,difference between a trip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:08.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,and a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:09.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:10.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,I love my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:11.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,I love being with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,them but when you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:15.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,are somewhere with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:15.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have one eye
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:16.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:17.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,You know, you have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:17.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,one eye open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can't actually take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:19.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,a nap by the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:21.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,pool because what if
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:21.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,one of the kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:21.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,slips?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:23.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if they slip?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:24.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if they get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:25.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,kidnapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:26.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if they're hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:27.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if they're hungry?
